-   "source": "## 9 — Next\n\nThis notebook leaves two artifacts in `WORK_DIR/data/processed/`:\n\n- `dataset_spec.json` — the frozen recipe (emotions, topics, prompt templates, decoding knobs, budget), keyed by `spec_hash`.\n- `prompts.jsonl` (+ `prompts_manifest.json`) — the materialised generation calls.\n\n`03_story_generation.ipynb` consumes both. It will:\n\n1. Resolve the same `WORK_DIR` (Drive on Colab / `EMOVEC_WORK_DIR` on HPC) and load `dataset_spec.json` + `prompts.jsonl`.\n2. Load `GENERATOR_MODEL` (overridable via `EMOVEC_GENERATOR_MODEL`) with sensible precision: bf16/fp16 on a big GPU, 4-bit (bitsandbytes) on a T4, `device_map=\"auto\"` across multiple GPUs on HPC.\n3. Iterate the prompt jobs in **batches**, decoding `n_outputs` per call, skipping any `job_id` already written (resume).\n4. Parse multi-story / multi-dialogue completions into individual segments (keeping the raw completion too), and rewrite `Person:`/`AI:` → `Human:`/`Assistant:` in dialogues, per Anthropic.\n5. Append results to `data/processed/stories/{spec_hash}/{model}/stories.jsonl`.\n\n`05_emotion_vectors.ipynb` will then:\n\n1. Compute `mean_emotion_activations` (per emotion) and `mean_neutral_dialogue_activations` (across the 100 topics).\n2. **Crucial step that's easy to miss:** PCA over the neutral-dialogue activations; keep top-k components (k = enough for 50 % explained variance); **project those components out** of each diff-of-means emotion vector. This removes the generic story-vs-dialogue style direction so the resulting vectors capture emotional content cleanly.\n3. Save 171 corrected vectors per layer.\n\nIf anything in this notebook's spec changes (model, prompt, budget), `spec_hash` shifts, every `job_id` shifts, and nb03 treats it as a fresh run.\n\n**Open follow-ups for this stage** (tracked in `meta/TODO.md`):\n\n- ✅ Canonical 171-emotion list, 100 topics, and prompts (story / neutral / emotional dialogue) in place verbatim.\n- ✅ Concrete prompt set materialised 